## SEO Customization

Default SEO values are loaded in `[[ module_name ]]/settings/base.py` and exposed to all templates via `[[ module_name ]]/context_processors.py`:

- Override `SITE_NAME`, `SITE_DESCRIPTION`, `SITE_AUTHOR`, or `DEFAULT_OG_IMAGE` in `.env`
- Add model sitemaps in `[[ module_name ]]/sitemaps.py` and register them in `[[ module_name ]]/urls.py`
